From b741fd5d78329f9cf46312ad95c1159b987bc385 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 11:02:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/18] Add achievements shown on the win screen

Seven achievements, unlocked once and remembered. Time targets are named
constants and design guesses until real players are timed. Continued runs
never earn achievements.
